From 1783dfb11a4262e4948bcbb9a5bee4a95ac734e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vm2-wasm-spike <spike@local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:13:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] spike: vm2_sim compiled and executed on wasm32-wasip1

Complete spike change set against upstream 233d8e0993, as executed. Includes the
vm2_spike driver (differential transcript incl. tree-snapshot roots) and the
vm2_sim_tests target that builds upstream's own vm2 simulation test suite --
neither of which upstream builds in any configuration.

Not an upstream submission: see codetracer-specs/upstream-bugs/aztec-* for the
reviewable patch series this stands behind.
